# hqbacktest has no environment variables of its own.
# Data is read by hqdata from local files; hqbacktest only forwards the
# `source` string (name or absolute path) to hqdata.api.
#
# Where data lives:
#   ~/.hqdata/                          default root directory
#   ~/.hqdata/{name}/                   resolved when source is a name
#                                        (e.g. "tushare" -> ~/.hqdata/tushare)
#   <absolute path>                     used directly when source is a path
#                                        (e.g. /home/<user>/.hqdata/tushare)
#
# If hqdata exposes overrides for the default root or for source lookup,
# declare them here; do NOT store real tokens, account numbers, or
# private paths in this file.
#
# Example (commented out, no real values):
# HQDATA_ROOT=/home/<user>/.hqdata